UnitVoterPaymentsModule::removeFee
├── when the caller does not hold the fee manager role
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
└── when the caller holds the fee manager role
    ├── when the target is the default slot
    │   └── it should revert with CannotRemoveDefault
    └── when the target is a concrete address
        ├── when the target has no registered record
        │   └── it should revert with NotRegistered
        ├── when the record is registered and the operation is restricted
        │   ├── it should clear the record
        │   └── it should emit FeeRemoved
        └── when the record is registered and the operation is not restricted
            ├── it should clear the record
            ├── it should leave the target resolving to the default rate
            └── it should emit FeeRemoved
